<!doctype html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <title>Git Demo - Repository</title>
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.11.3/font/bootstrap-icons.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        :root {
            --page-bg: #f6f8fa;
            --border: #d0d7de;
            --muted: #57606a;
            --link: #0969da;
            --success: #1a7f37;
            --surface: #ffffff;
        }

        body {
            background: var(--page-bg);
            color: #24292f;
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
        }

        .topbar {
            background: #ffffff;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
        }

        .brand-mark {
            width: 32px;
            height: 32px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            display: inline-grid;
            place-items: center;
            color: #ffffff;
            background: #24292f;
        }

        .repo-shell,
        .panel,
        .file-row {
            background: var(--surface);
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 6px;
        }

        .repo-title a,
        .file-row a {
            color: var(--link);
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        .repo-title a:hover,
        .file-row a:hover {
            text-decoration: underline;
        }

        .nav-tabs .nav-link {
            color: #24292f;
            border: 0;
            border-bottom: 2px solid transparent;
            border-radius: 0;
        }

        .nav-tabs .nav-link.active {
            background: transparent;
            border-bottom-color: #fd8c73;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .btn {
            border-radius: 6px;
        }

        .muted {
            color: var(--muted);
        }

        .branch-pill,
        .topic-pill {
            background: #f6f8fa;
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 999px;
            color: #24292f;
            font-size: .85rem;
            padding: .2rem .55rem;
        }

        .code-line {
            font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Consolas, monospace;
            font-size: .9rem;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<nav class="topbar navbar navbar-expand-lg">
    <div class="container-xl">
        <a class="navbar-brand d-flex align-items-center gap-2 fw-semibold" href="/repository">
            <span class="brand-mark"><i class="bi bi-git"></i></span>
            Git Demo
        </a>
        <button class="navbar-toggler" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#mainNav">
            <span class="navbar-toggler-icon"></span>
        </button>
        <div class="collapse navbar-collapse" id="mainNav">
            <ul class="navbar-nav ms-auto small fw-medium">
                <li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link active" href="/repository">Repository</a></li>
                <li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="issue.html">Issue</a></li>
                <li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="branch.html">Branch</a></li>
                <li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="commit.html">Commit</a></li>
                <li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="collaborator.html">Collaborator</a></li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </div>
</nav>

<main class="container-xl py-4">
    <section class="repo-shell p-4 mb-3">
        <div class="d-flex flex-wrap justify-content-between align-items-start gap-3">
            <div>
                <div class="repo-title h3 mb-1">
                    <i class="bi bi-journal-code me-2 muted"></i>
                        <a href="#">
                            <%= repository.owner %>/<%= repository.name %>
                        </a>
                    <span class="badge text-bg-light border fw-normal ms-2"><%= repository.visibility %></span>
                </div>
                <p class="muted mb-3">
                    <%= repository.description  %>
                </p>
                <div class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-2">
                    <span class="topic-pill">git</span>
                    <span class="topic-pill">version-control</span>
                    <span class="topic-pill">demo</span>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="d-flex gap-2">
                <button class="btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm"><i class="bi bi-star me-1"></i>
                    <%= repository.stars %>
                </button>
                <button class="btn btn-success btn-sm"><i class="bi bi-code-slash me-1"></i>Code</button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <ul class="nav nav-tabs mb-3">
        <li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link active" href="#"><i class="bi bi-code me-1"></i>Code</a></li>
        <li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="issue.html"><i class="bi bi-record-circle me-1"></i>Issues</a>
        </li>
        <li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="branch.html"><i class="bi bi-diagram-3 me-1"></i>Branches</a>
        </li>
        <li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="commit.html"><i class="bi bi-clock-history me-1"></i>Commits</a>
        </li>
    </ul>

    <div class="row g-3">
        <div class="col-lg-8">
            <div class="panel overflow-hidden">
                <div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center p-3 border-bottom">
                    <span class="branch-pill"><i class="bi bi-diagram-2 me-1"></i>main</span>
                    <span class="small muted">Ultimo commit: actualizar README</span>
                </div>
                <div class="file-row border-0 border-bottom rounded-0 p-3 d-flex justify-content-between">
                    <span><i class="bi bi-folder me-2 text-primary"></i><a href="#">src</a></span>
                    <span class="small muted">estructura inicial</span>
                </div>
                <div class="file-row border-0 border-bottom rounded-0 p-3 d-flex justify-content-between">
                    <span><i class="bi bi-folder me-2 text-primary"></i><a href="#">views</a></span>
                    <span class="small muted">vistas demo</span>
                </div>
                <div class="file-row border-0 border-bottom rounded-0 p-3 d-flex justify-content-between">
                    <span><i class="bi bi-file-earmark-text me-2 muted"></i><a href="#">README.md</a></span>
                    <span class="small muted">documentacion del proyecto</span>
                </div>
                <div class="file-row border-0 rounded-0 p-3 d-flex justify-content-between">
                    <span><i class="bi bi-file-earmark-code me-2 muted"></i><a href="#">package.json</a></span>
                    <span class="small muted">dependencias y scripts</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <aside class="col-lg-4">
            <div class="panel p-3 mb-3">
                <h2 class="h6">Que contiene un repositorio</h2>
                <p class="small muted mb-0">Incluye el arbol de archivos, el historial de cambios, metadatos internos en
                    <span class="code-line">.git</span>, configuracion remota y referencias a ramas o etiquetas.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="panel p-3 mb-3">
                <h2 class="h6">Lenguaje principal</h2>
                <p class="small muted mb-0"><%= repository.language %></p>
            </div>
            <div class="panel p-3 mb-3">
                <h2 class="h6">Última actualización</h2>
                <p class="small muted mb-0"><%= repository.updatedAt %></p>
            </div>
            <div class="panel p-3">
                <h2 class="h6">Flujo basico</h2>
                <ol class="small muted mb-0 ps-3">
                    <li>Crear o clonar el repositorio.</li>
                    <li>Editar archivos en el directorio de trabajo.</li>
                    <li>Guardar cambios con commits.</li>
                    <li>Compartirlos mediante push y pull.</li>
                </ol>
            </div>
        </aside>
    </div>
</main>

<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
